{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>新民黨立法會議員陳家珮去信文體旅局，要求終止在山頂的燈光裝置。</p><p></p><p>裝置是配合旅發局「香港繽紛冬日巡禮」光影匯演。</p><p></p><p>陳家珮指收到眾多市民、居民及行山人士反對意見。她考察後認為項目規劃願景，與實際環境存在顯著落差，設施對山徑視覺觀感，造成嚴重負面影響。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.PEAK-1700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ffaxC9mUuU1792576187.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>又批評工程開掘土地，對大自然造成不可逆轉的破壞，威脅野生動物生態。部分電線及裝置位置過低，亦造成安全隱患，建議當局考慮終止項目。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.PEAK-1700_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wOMqj6s4rU1792576207.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>旅發局早前稱會跟進，適時再交代。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:40:23.332210+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:39.656837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:39.656837+00:00","content_hash":"ced27aef1bc456fd62de2fd2d0f3b2efbb024d81e1dda63556c38cae4b9424ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}